---
interface Props {
  questions: string[];
}
const { questions } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="hub-section" aria-labelledby="defend">
  <h2 id="defend">Could you defend the other side?</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    Before criticizing this page, could you explain why a reasonable person supports the strongest version of
    the argument?
  </p>
  <ol class="stack">
    {questions.map((q) => <li>{q}</li>)}
  </ol>
  <p class="muted">
    If you can only recite a slogan, we failed. Success means you can articulate the best version of the
    argument—even when you disagree.
  </p>
</section>
